  "body": "A [Last-Event-ID](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/comms.html#last-event-id) header value is set to the [last event ID string](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/comms.html#concept-event-stream-last-event-id) which can contain any chars except CR and LF. On the other hand, the [Fetch spec](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-header-list-set) requires that a header value consists of [field-content](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7230#section-3.2) octets. The former allows non-CRLF control octets while the latter doesn't. \n",
